      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Their position with respect to that language was the position that my friend just articulated. Every single person who walked into a Labcorp facility had those rights denied regardless of whether they wanted to use a kiosk or not. That's what he just stood up and told you was their understanding of who's injured, and that fits within that definition."
